# Replicate's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-replicate-setting-cookie = 登录 https://replicate.com/account/billing，打开开发者工具 > Application > Cookies > https://replicate.com，将 sessionid（以及存在时的 csrftoken）复制为一条 "sessionid=value; csrftoken=value" 标头。此处不能使用 API 令牌。

## The report: this month's spend, the credit balance, and the account the
## token belongs to. The user or organization name stays as Replicate
## sends it.

usage-replicate-spent-this-month = 本月已花费
usage-replicate-credit-balance = 积分余额
usage-replicate-account = 账号
usage-replicate-organization = 组织
usage-replicate-user = 用户
